graph TB
    subgraph "odh-cli (rhai-cli / kubectl-odh)"
        direction TB

        subgraph "Command Layer"
            LintCmd[lint<br/>Upgrade Readiness]
            MigrateCmd[migrate<br/>Version Transitions]
            StatusCmd[status<br/>Cluster Health]
            BackupCmd[backup<br/>Workload Export]
            ComponentsCmd[components<br/>Lifecycle Mgmt]
            DepsCmd[deps<br/>Dependency Tracking]
            GetCmd[get<br/>Resource Viewer]
            EventsCmd[events<br/>Event Monitoring]
            LogsCmd[logs<br/>Log Streaming]
            MCPCmd[mcp serve<br/>AI Agent Interface]
        end

        subgraph "Framework Layer"
            LintRegistry[Lint Check Registry<br/>40+ checks, 5 categories]
            MigrateRegistry[Migration Action Registry<br/>Phase-aware execution]
            StepRecorder[Step Recorder<br/>Hierarchical tracking]
            OutputEnvelope[Output Envelope<br/>Table/JSON/YAML]
        end

        subgraph "MCP Layer"
            MCPServer[MCP Server<br/>stdio / SSE transport]
            ToolAdapter[Tool Adapter<br/>Command → MCP bridge]
        end

        subgraph "Client Layer"
            K8sClient[Kubernetes Client<br/>client-go]
            ConfigFlags[Config Flags<br/>kubeconfig, QPS, Burst]
            VersionDetector[Version Detector<br/>CSV + ClusterVersion]
        end

        LintCmd -->|registers checks| LintRegistry
        MigrateCmd -->|registers actions| MigrateRegistry
        MigrateRegistry -->|records steps| StepRecorder
        MCPCmd -->|starts| MCPServer
        MCPServer -->|wraps commands| ToolAdapter

        LintCmd --> K8sClient
        MigrateCmd --> K8sClient
        StatusCmd --> K8sClient
        BackupCmd --> K8sClient
        ComponentsCmd --> K8sClient
        DepsCmd --> K8sClient
        GetCmd --> K8sClient
        EventsCmd --> K8sClient
        LogsCmd --> K8sClient
        ToolAdapter --> ConfigFlags

        K8sClient --> ConfigFlags
        K8sClient --> VersionDetector
    end

    User[Platform Operator] -->|kubectl odh ...| LintCmd
    User -->|kubectl odh migrate| MigrateCmd
    User -->|kubectl odh status| StatusCmd
    AIAgent[AI Agent] -->|MCP Protocol| MCPServer

    K8sClient -->|HTTPS/6443| K8sAPI[Kubernetes API Server]
    K8sClient -->|reads| DSC[DataScienceCluster CR]
    K8sClient -->|reads| DSCI[DSCInitialization CR]
    K8sClient -->|reads/writes| WorkloadCRs[Workload CRs<br/>Notebooks, DSPA,<br/>InferenceService, RayCluster]

